{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40122","label":"COIN RUSH SHOWDOWN · Part 2"},"label":"The Scent of Flowers: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_coinrushshowdown2_intermission_01","next":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_e","speakers":{"guardleader":"Head of Security","flora_b":"Flora","sin_b":"Sin","guilty_b":"Guilty","mana_b":"Mana"},"icons":{"guardleader":"si_c999_00_s","flora_b":"si_c411_01_s","sin_b":"si_c405_00_s","guilty_b":"si_c404_00_s","mana_b":"si_c290_01_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_1","text":"Uh... Due to this unexpected turn of events, we are currently discussing how to proceed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CoinRushMainHall","bgArt":"coinrushmainhall","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_cir_startagem","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_2","text":"Please bear with us for a moment before we move on to the final round.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_3","text":"An event meant for everyone to enjoy has been thrown into chaos by a certain company blinded by their desire to win.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_4","text":"We will make an announcement as soon as the situation is under control.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"guardleader","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_5","text":"In the meantime, please enjoy all that Coin Rush, the Ark's premier entertainment venue, has to offer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_6","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_6","text":"The guards rush off somewhere.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_7","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_7","text":"They're not even firing their suppression rounds at the eliminated participants. That's how unprecedented this must be for the organizers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_8","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_8","text":"Sin and Guilty step off the stage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["sin_b","guilty_b","flora_b"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_9","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_9","text":"As we walk away, we're met with a barrage of jeers and hostile glares.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_10","text":"... Okay. We managed to buy ourselves some time with this unexpected situation, though I feel kind of bad for everyone who got eliminated...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_11","text":"Aster must've been taken by the organizers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_12","text":"I think we can assume she's being held captive, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_13","text":"But she didn't tell us where she is. All she did was look for more alcohol...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_14","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_14","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_15","text":"Even though Mana interrupted the broadcast, she didn't tell us her location.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_04_s_16","text":"All she did was mention beer. Her life would probably have been at risk if she ha